/*!
\page page_stPhmdModule StPhmdModule

\brief Supermodule of the STAR PHMD, holding pad-cell hits.

\section phmdModule_overview Overview

StPhmdModule groups the StPhmdHit objects from one supermodule of a
STAR PHMD plane (PMD or CPV).  Each PHMD plane has 12 supermodules covering
different azimuthal sectors; each supermodule contains a honeycomb pad array.

\section phmdModule_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StPhmdModule
\endcode

Owned by \ref page_stPhmdDetector "StPhmdDetector"; accessed via
\c StPhmdDetector::module(uint).

\section phmdModule_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|---|---|---|
| StSPtrVecPhmdHit | mHits | Strongly-owned collection of pad-cell hits in this supermodule. |

\section phmdModule_methods Key Methods

- \c numberOfHits() — number of fired cells.
- \c hits() — mutable/const access to the hit vector.

\section phmdModule_seealso See Also

\ref page_stPhmdHit "StPhmdHit",
\ref page_stPhmdDetector "StPhmdDetector",
\ref page_stPhmdCluster "StPhmdCluster"
*/
